07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tzZztzvtEJoQ7kNvwGu9mJr&_nc_oc=AdoFm6K7p_4Q1aQDdKg78zy57kw_1qjbYNIkc4RXk4WDobKFQDwrr7GGNJntNeT8gvk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOAxcnubTJO6H_R9RyO8MOh5zATdbh4_3XkYNO8UpJruA&oe=6ADF6142"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aMnGsB_zcuMQ7kNvwE-5q7v&_nc_oc=AdpOq9nnci-gJn66RYD8iMbN_NxmzXA8TnzzBnlgoavbqtzZqjkFGj5DnSt3GX_NfVE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP1kLzT8n1vs7wzlnUYDUQCsQ7phdOOS8gh_9DUnn6v3g&oe=6ADF56BF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ppVGGMbB4kEQ7kNvwGjknQC&_nc_oc=Ado7mXLab6Ihx6k45H7h3_FURUNBpdOaLlCqZ_IiTOa52RiaawlzA81Z3MAljS28CK0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNpPWZdkTL8JOlE5u73i69Wpg8Fbo1Lt4jebdWhe_BzIQ&oe=6ADF65B0"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic